{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Sweet Gem Berry is a ",["l","农作物","crop"]," that grows from a ",["l","稀有种子","Rare Seed"]," after 24 days. It is not considered a ",["l","水果","Fruit"]," or ",["l","蔬菜","Vegetable"]," and cannot be used in a ",["l","小桶","Keg"]," or ",["l","罐头瓶","Preserves Jar"],", nor does it benefit from the ",["l","耕种","Tiller profession"],"."]],["p",[["l","稀有种子","Rare Seed"],"s can be purchased from the ",["l","旅行货车","Traveling Cart"]," for 1,000g in ",["l","春季","Spring"]," & ",["l","夏季","Summer"],", or for 600–1,000g in any season. A ",["l","种子生产器","Seed Maker"]," can also produce Rare Seeds from a Sweet Gem Berry."]],["p",["Despite its high sell price, the berry is regarded as a ",["l","友谊","neutral gift"]," by all the NPCs in ",["l","Stardew Valley","Stardew Valley"],". When given to ",["l","老师傅香炸奶酪卷","Old Master Cannoli"]," in the ",["l","秘密森林","Secret Woods"],", the player receives a ",["l","星之果实","Stardrop"]," in return. In ",["l","合作","multiplayer"],", all players receive a Stardrop with the gift of a single berry."]]]],["Stages",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Stage 1"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 2"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 3"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 4"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 5"]},{"h":1,"v":["Harvest"]}],[["2 Days"],["4 Days"],["6 Days"],["6 Days"],["6 Days"],["Total: 24 Days"]]]]]],["Crop Growth Calendar",2,[["t",[[{"c":7,"h":1,"v":["Base"]}],[{"h":1,"v":["Mon"]},{"h":1,"v":["Tue"]},{"h":1,"v":["Wed"]},{"h":1,"v":["Thu"]},{"h":1,"v":["Fri"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sat"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sun"]}]]],["t",[[{"c":4,"h":1,"v":["Agriculturist and Speed-Gro Comparison"]}],[{"h":1,"v":[]},{"h":1,"v":[["l","生长激素","Speed-Gro"]]},{"h":1,"v":[["l","高级生长激素","Deluxe Speed-Gro"]]},{"h":1,"v":[["l","顶级生长激素","Hyper Speed-Gro"]]}],[{"r":2,"h":1,"v":[]},{"b":[["t",[[{"c":7,"h":1,"v":["10%*"]}],[{"h":1,"v":["Mon"]},{"h":1,"v":["Tue"]},{"h":1,"v":["Wed"]},{"h":1,"v":["Thu"]},{"h":1,"v":["Fri"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sat"]},{"h":1,"v":["Sun"]}]]]]},{"b":[["t",[[{"c":7,"h":1,"v":["25%"]}],[{"h":1,"v":["Mon"]},{"h":1